    "description": "Clickable white-label wireframe for the sign up/login user journey.\n\n**Parent epic:** ROKJ-1 | **Stage:** Stage 1 | **Stack:** Expo + React Native\n\n## Prototype links (run locally first)\n\n1. In the Rokjam repo: `npm install && npm run web`\n2. Open the **scenario tester** (all review paths in one place):\n\n    * http://localhost:8081/scenarios\n    \n3. Or use direct scenario links:\n\n| Scenario | Link |\n| --- | --- |\n| Scenario tester (recommended) | http://localhost:8081/scenarios |\n| App welcome | http://localhost:8081/ |\n| Sign up | http://localhost:8081/auth/signup |\n| Verify email (code) | http://localhost:8081/auth/verify-email |\n| Log in | http://localhost:8081/auth/login |\n| Forgot password | http://localhost:8081/auth/forgot-password |\n\n**Mock credentials:** `returning.user@example.com` or `alex_climber` / `Password1!`\n\n**Expo Go:** run `npm start` and scan the QR code, then open **Scenario tester** from the welcome screen.\n\n**Out of scope:** Real auth, branding/design system (ROKJ-5)",
    "customfield_10055": null,
